{"synopsis":"Setelah semua orang yang dicintainya direnggut darinya, Yeo Woon-hwi kehilangan kewarasannya dan hidup sebagai \"Iblis Darah\" hingga akhirnya menemui ajalnya.\n\n\n\nTepat ketika ia mengira tirai telah jatuh pada kehidupan tragisnya, sebuah suara yang familiar bergema: \"Ayah!\"\n\n\n\nDiberi kesempatan kedua, waktu berputar kembali ke saat sebelum ia kehilangan segalanya.\n\n\n\nSekarang, ia bersumpah untuk mengabdikan tubuh dan jiwanya untuk melindungi keluarganya... Tapi kali ini, ia tidak akan menjadi \"Iblis Darah\"... ia akan naik menjadi \"Dewa Bela Diri\"!","alternative_title":"우리 아빠는 천하제일인","author":"Yu-dam, Gyeol","artist":"Lee Jeong, Terapin Studio","chapters":[{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"1f7bd2d7-98f1-4c49-887e-6623d7f5ce1b","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-08-22"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"aa3185dc-a5d8-4d1e-bf34-84f7117c1f21","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"434fa8e5-e4cd-47f2-9c90-19643c4dee90","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"98b2483b-b6c3-4336-82bc-f8882da9c6ac","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"21","chapter":"21","slug":"038d7761-d4ef-41df-ba78-58ac34d6ead5","title":"Chapter 21","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"20","chapter":"20","slug":"9a1dcf32-7033-420c-8da4-b4b978cf834a","title":"Chapter 20","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"19","chapter":"19","slug":"6c723891-9191-4868-98ea-d14fd328a2ba","title":"Chapter 19","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"18","chapter":"18","slug":"ef3a8f16-6ff6-42dc-8a75-391e29b57642","title":"Chapter 18","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"17","chapter":"17","slug":"6e21ef89-2f8e-4eec-beaa-969fb83330fc","title":"Chapter 17","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"16","chapter":"16","slug":"b5dc6cb3-9c5c-4eed-a875-6177252a1fab","title":"Chapter 16","date":"2026-08-17"},{"number":"15","chapter":"15","slug":"bac0e545-2c42-496f-a33d-a1465f5730ae","title":"Chapter 15","date":"2026-08-17"},{"numbe